  "description": "Circuit-level design of switching voltage regulators that convert DC to a different regulated DC voltage by high-frequency PWM energy transfer through inductors and capacitors. Covers buck (step-down), boost (step-up), buck-boost (inverting), and flyback (isolated) topologies with duty-cycle control, efficiency analysis, and ripple calculation. Owns the circuit-design pedagogy; system-level converter manufacturing is covered by power-electronics.",
